      "message": "Say who somebody is over the API, as a tool, and at the terminal\n\nA person's page says who they are; now the API says it too, at\nGET /api/principals/{id}/profile: their kind and the name they go by,\nwhat they say about themself with the time where they are now, when\nthey arrived, the agents acting in their name, and their record over a\nwindow. For an agent, its model, its harness and who holds it. Anyone\nsigned in may ask, the way anyone may read the page.\n\nThe MCP tool `whois` and `ambolt whois <name>` ask the same question,\nso an agent chooses a reviewer by their record and their hours rather\nthan by guessing, and a person at a terminal learns who an author is\nbefore trusting a claim.\n\nChange-Id: Iwhois0168\nTask: t-43y787gn7r1k4zrd26x2n7ys0f\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
